{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Because.</b> Like סבה (cause), למען (for the sake of). סבב (to come about), for all is in parts, in parts of the whole, which is the body:" "<b>Giving you shall give.</b> The meaning: if you give to him, HaShem will add to your wealth."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {0 "The lemma בגלל is translated 'because' per standard English Bible versions. The three Hebrew synonyms are left in Hebrew script; their exact syntactic relationship to each other and to the rest of the sentence is compressed and obscure in the original."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:23:32.807379704Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}